<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:66"><p>
	The Salvation Army Women's Auxiliary groups have been around for decades. These women have served with the "Heart to God, Hand to Man" philosophy of the worldwide Salvation Army. Serving as a fund-raising and volunteer service group, the women of the Auxiliary have impacted the lives of people in need of services provided by The Salvation Army&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;Hinds, Madison, Rankin, Scott, Yazoo and Copiah counties.&nbsp;
</p>

<p>
	The Salvation Army Women's Auxiliary's membership is always open. We exist for the sole purpose of helping others. Serving others&nbsp;is the core of every project we support and promote. Our mission is to be “The Army Behind The Army” helping The Salvation Army meet the need of others.
</p></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:3:30"></div>
<div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/0848a12b-c18a-464f-949d-80479b708809_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;" class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:68">
