                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;">
                    <p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	Meetings are held on the
</p>

<h5 style="text-align:center;">Second Wednesday of Each Month</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	At our Community Worship Center (570 Beasley Rd.)&nbsp;at 11:30am<br>
	For lunch followed by our membership meeting from 12pm-1pm.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	We would love to have you!
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
	<em><strong>To get more involved in our community, consider joining our Women's Auxiliary.</strong></em>
</p>
