<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 mt-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:7:86"><h5 style="text-align:center;"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><span style="font-size:20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;Become a Member Today&nbsp;to Help in Your Community All Year Long</span></span></h5>

<h5 style="text-align:center;">Types of Memberships:</h5>

<ul>
	<li><strong>ACTIVE MEMBER - $30</strong>
<ul>
		<li>I wish to attend and participate in meetings, activities, and projects and volunteer a minimum 25 hours.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><strong>SUPPORTING MEMBER - $50</strong><ul>
		<li>I am unable to attend meetings but will lend a hand on projects as I am able.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><strong>CONTRIBUTING&nbsp;MEMBER&nbsp;- $100</strong><ul>
		<li>I will give financial support and attend meetings as I am able.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><strong>SPONSORING MEMBER - $250</strong><ul>
		<li>I will give financial support for special projects only. I wish to be kept informed of events through newsletters and minutes.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	Click <strong><a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/8b2c2b27-648c-4d84-9767-955c0c53b504_SAWA+Membership+Application+Updated.pdf" target="">HERE</a></strong>&nbsp;for our downloadable Membership Application.<br>
	<em><strong>Print It Out, Fill It Out, and Mail It Back as Directed!</strong></em>
</p>

